  "guidebook": {
    "intro": "Simu na jumbe ndivyo mipango inavyofanywa. Sehemu hii pia inaonyesha jinsi Kiganda kinavyoweka “mimi”, “wewe” na “yeye” ndani ya kitenzi, sawasawa na Kiswahili.",
