    "tips": [
      {
        "id": "object-markers",
        "title": "Mimi, wewe, yeye ndani ya kitenzi",
        "body": [
          "Mtendwa huingia ndani ya kitenzi, kati ya mtendaji na shina la kitenzi, kama Kiswahili **ni-na-ku-pigia**: **n-ku-kubira** (ni-ku-pigia), **m-mu-kubira** (ni-m-pigia). Viambishi karibu ni vilevile: **-ku-** (wewe), **-mu-** (yeye), **-tu-** (sisi), **-ba-** (wao, Kiswahili **-wa-**).",
          "Kwa “mimi”, kiambishi ni **n-** (Kiswahili **-ni-**), na hubadilisha sauti inayofuata kama n- ya “mimi” mtendaji: **Nkubira** (nipigie), **Mpa** (nipe), **Mpeereza** (nitumie)."
        ],
